---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Navbar from "../../components/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
import CtaBand from "../../components/CtaBand.astro";
import Comments from "../../components/Comments.astro";
import { whatsappLink } from "../../config";
---

<Layout
	title="How to Choose a Web Designer in Kenya: Scorecard (2026) | Orbit"
	description="Neutral scorecard to pick a web designer in Kenya: price, timeline, M-Pesa, speed, ownership, support — works on any quote."
>
	<Navbar />
	<main id="main">
		<section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-white/5">
			<div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true">
				<div class="absolute -top-40 left-1/3 h-[400px] w-[600px] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-electric/15 blur-[130px]"></div>
			</div>
			<div class="relative mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 pb-14 pt-20 md:pt-28">
				<p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-electric">■ Guides · Choosing · 5 min</p>
				<h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">
					Choosing a designer? <span class="text-gradient">Use this scorecard.</span>
				</h1>
				<p class="mt-5 text-lg text-slate-400">6 questions that work on any quote — including ours. Score 0–2 each.</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-16">
			<div class="grid gap-4">
				<div class="glow-border rounded-2xl p-6"><h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">1. Exact price in writing?</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400">0 = "depends", 1 = range, 2 = fixed KES with what's included listed. Our prices: 29,999 / 39,999 / 49,999. Demand the same list from anyone.</p></div>
				<div class="glow-border rounded-2xl p-6"><h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">2. Live date, not range?</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400">0 = "2–4 weeks", 2 = "3–5d Starter / 1–2wk Business / 2–3wk Master" with approval gate before launch.</p></div>
				<div class="glow-border rounded-2xl p-6"><h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">3. M-Pesa native or plugin?</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400">Plugin checkouts break on update and feel slow. 2 = native Daraja wiring you can see in dashboard. Ask to screen-share a test KES 10.</p></div>
				<div class="glow-border rounded-2xl p-6"><h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">4. Speed on cheap phone data?</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400">Ask for their PageSpeed number on mobile (not fibre) + a live site to test. 2 = 90+ on <a href="https://pagespeed.web.dev" class="text-electric hover:underline">pagespeed.web.dev</a>.</p></div>
				<div class="glow-border rounded-2xl p-6"><h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">5. Who owns what?</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400">Read terms before paying. 2 = your domain/content/files, full license, M-Pesa creds in your name — see our <a href="/terms-of-service" class="text-electric hover:underline">Terms</a>.</p></div>
				<div class="glow-border rounded-2xl p-6"><h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">6. What happens after launch?</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400">A site without care rots. 2 = monthly listed (hosting/security/backups/support) with reply time. Ours 6,500–11,999, cancel anytime — or DIY with checklist in <a href="/blog/website-care-kenya" class="text-electric hover:underline">Care guide</a>.</p></div>
			</div>
			<div class="mt-8 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 bg-amber-500/5 p-5 text-sm text-slate-300">
				<p class="font-semibold text-white">Score: 10–12 = hire, 7–9 = ask more, &lt;7 = walk away. Red flags: won't put price/date in writing, no PageSpeed number, "lifetime hosting free".</p>
			</div>
			<div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-edge bg-panel p-6">
				<p class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Challenge us</p>
				<p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-400">Send any competitor quote — we'll score both honestly. <a href={whatsappLink("Hi Orbit! I'm comparing designers — score my quote vs yours?")} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-electric hover:underline">WhatsApp the quote →</a></p>
			</div>
		</article>

		<Comments slug="best-web-designer-kenya" />
		<CtaBand title="Compare us live." text="No pitch — just numbers, side by side." />
	</main>
	<Footer />
</Layout>
